  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Costa Rica National Plastic Action Partnership (CR-NPAP) Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Iniciativa de Plataforma Nacional de Accion sobre los Pl&#xe1;sticos (Costa Rica)The project aims to serve as the National Plastic Action Partnership (NPAP) Secretariat and host organization in Costa Rica, fostering multi-stakeholder collaboration to implement innovative, sustainable, and inclusive solutions to eliminate plastic pollution. By enhancing partnerships, increasing awareness, and driving behavioral change, the project seeks to align national efforts with global standards, contributing significantly to the sustainable development goals (SDGs) and protecting Costa Ricas rich biodiversity and marine environment</narrative>
  </description>
